SCOPE NOTE, NOT A MODIFICATION OF THE TERMS ABOVE

The MIT grant covers the code, notebooks, documentation and result artifacts in
this repository.

It does not cover the job-description text in `Data/`. That text was scraped from
public LinkedIn postings and remains the property of its original authors. It is
included for research reproducibility only. Redistribution for commercial use is
not granted here, and no ownership of it is claimed. See section 8 of
`docs/DATA_CARD.md` before reusing the data.

The resume texts and match scores in `Data/` are synthetic. They describe no real
person, and any resemblance to a real candidate is coincidental.
